    {
      "id": "claim_557fb4639c464334a2e00b3f7145bac4",
      "statement": "When HC_RAG_RERANKER=pinecone is enabled, retrieve_documents passes limit=rerank_candidates to the search callable only if it accepts a limit kwarg (accepts_limit), then rerank_documents trims each collection's results back down to rerank_top_k inside the traced retriever run, keeping the amount of context reaching generation constant.",
