    {
      "id": "claim_99f84238785140aca1f9c7e3527597eb",
      "statement": "PageIndex trees are built offline by make index-pageindex via healthcare_rag/storage/pageindex_index.py, which runs pageindex (needing openai>=2) in an ephemeral uv env because the app pins openai<2; the runtime never imports the pageindex package and only reads the cached tree/chunk JSON, raising FileNotFoundError with a fix-it message if either file is missing. Trees and chunks are memoised in-process and can be dropped with clear_cache(); HC_RAG_PAGEINDEX_DIR relocates the data directory.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://healthcare_rag/processors/pageindex_retrieval.py#L43-L73",
