    {
      "id": "claim_4f049f71dd16428f86b7c4af395fafa5",
      "statement": "Because Pinecone has no server-side alpha, convex_scale reproduces Weaviate's hybrid weighting on a dotproduct index by scaling dense *= alpha and sparse *= 1 - alpha (HC_RAG_PINECONE_ALPHA, default 0.65 to match the Weaviate arm); an alpha outside [0,1] raises ValueError.",
