    {
      "id": "claim_572bee94f92a4ec496e417e80e31cf5b",
      "statement": "The reranker (healthcare_rag/processors/rerank.py, HC_RAG_RERANKER=pinecone) is part of the retrieval stage rather than a new pipeline stage: it uses Pinecone Inference (HC_RAG_RERANK_MODEL, default bge-reranker-v2-m3, via Resources.pinecone_client) to rerank HC_RAG_RERANK_CANDIDATES (default 12) candidates down to HC_RAG_RERANK_TOP_K (default 4, matching the un-reranked limit) and works on any retrieval arm, not only Pinecone's own.",
