    {
      "id": "claim_93fb10784b8443bd9332f9ae60af8aa8",
      "statement": "rerank_documents is deliberately fail-soft: any exception during the Pinecone Inference call is caught, logged as RERANK_FAILED, and the function returns the search's own ordering truncated to top_k, so a reranker outage degrades quality but never availability; reorder() also skips out-of-range or duplicate indices in a malformed rerank response so it degrades to a shorter list rather than a corrupt one.",
