      "statement": "evals/pageindex_gate.py (the retrieval-arm gate) is a distinct evaluator from evals/routing_gate.py and its supporting modules (routing_gate_args.py, routing_gate_runner.py, routing_gate_verdicts.py, etc.), which gate query/safety decision-routing arms rather than retrieval-search arms.",
